    "updated_at": "2024-08-08T23:09:02Z",
    "body": "I've just uploaded the latest iteration. It uses unique internal values to represent timers, and a separate map from setTimeout IDs to those unique internal values.\r\nI also managed to cleanly separate the two algorithms, and remove the special-casing from \"run steps after a timeout\". All in all I think it turned out quite well, let me know what you think.",
